FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 818589C
	.string "Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "FORTREE GYM LEADER WINONA is a\n"
	.string "master of FLYING-type DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "She's waiting at the back of this GYM,\n"
	.string "behind the rotating doors.\p"
	.string "She's waiting for new challengers who\n"
	.string "are trying to take wing!\p"
	.string "Okay, go for it!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 8185994
	.string "You did it!\n"
	.string "You've achieved liftoff!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_JaredIntro:: @ 81859B9
	.string "Behold the elegant battle style of\n"
	.string "BIRD DIGIMON!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_JaredDefeat:: @ 81859EA
	.string "You...\n"
	.string "You're strong...$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_JaredPostBattle:: @ 8185A02
	.string "A TRAINER has to be smart to keep\n"
	.string "up with unexpected turns of events.\p"
	.string "Let's see if you have the smarts to\n"
	.string "get to our LEADER?$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WillIntro:: @ 8185A7F
	.string "The lovers of BIRD DIGIMON aspire\n"
	.string "to join this GYM.\p"
	.string "As a member of the FORTREE GYM,\n"
	.string "I'm not allowed to lose!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WillDefeat:: @ 8185AEC
	.string "It was too much of a load for me\n"
	.string "to bear...$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WillPostBattle:: @ 8185B18
	.string "The world is huge, and there are\n"
	.string "countless tough TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "I'm going to keep training and make\n"
	.string "myself even stronger.$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_TerrellIntro:: @ 8185B8D
	.string "There's no need for WINONA, our GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER, to deal with you!\p"
	.string "I'm plenty good enough for you!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_TerrellDefeat:: @ 8185BEB
	.string "WINONA, I...\n"
	.string "I lost!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_TerrellPostBattle:: @ 8185C00
	.string "WINONA is cute and she's strong.\n"
	.string "She's the ultimate LEADER!\p"
	.string "Blush...$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_KyleeIntro:: @ 8185C45
	.string "WINONA taught me personally!\n"
	.string "You can't beat me easily!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_KyleeDefeat:: @ 8185C7C
	.string "I was beaten...$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_KyleePostBattle:: @ 8185C8C
	.string "Thanks to WINONA, the people of\n"
	.string "FORTREE can live without fear.$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaIntro:: @ 8185CCB
	.string "WINONA: I guard the FEATHER KEY,\n"
	.string "one of eight locks on the way\p"
	.string "home.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaDefeat:: @ 8185DBA
	.string "WINONA: Your bond endured. The\n"
	.string "FEATHER KEY now belongs to you.$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedFeatherBadge:: @ 8185E48
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 6:\n"
	.string "FEATHER!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_ExplainFeatherBadgeTakeThis:: @ 8185E73
	.string "The FEATHER KEY restores access\n"
	.string "to FLY outside battle. Its other\p"
	.string "battle permissions remain\n"
	.string "active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_ExplainAerialAce:: @ 8185F4A
	.string "TM40 contains AERIAL ACE.\p"
	.string "Its speed...\n"
	.string "No DIGIMON should be able to avoid it.$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaPostBattle:: @ 8185F98
	.string "You have the FEATHER KEY. Keep\n"
	.string "seeking the remaining guardians.\p"
	.string "The gate home needs all eight.\n"
	.string "Your partner is your anchor; do\p"
	.string "not lose hope.$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:: @ 8185FD5
	.string "FORTREE CITY DIGIMON GYM$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:: @ 8185FEE
	.string "FORTREE CITY DIGIMON GYM\p"
	.string "WINONA'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
